# Worksheet

**F1 Core loop:** One state object `S` (newGame); `rnd(S)` mulberry32 seeded via `S.rngi`, used everywhere; `finishTurn()` resolves doProduction→doNeeds→doMorale→doStorm→doCaravan→clampCaps→maybeNewcomer in fixed order. Score 2.

**F2 Map:** `genMap(seed)` builds 64 tiles from seeded `mkRng`; `canBuild` checks `B.terr.includes(t.t)`; `adjBonus()` feeds `bldEff()` multiplier, changing output. Score 2.

**F3 Economy:** Chains ash→soil→food, ore→metal→parts (`conv{i,o}` in `doProduction`); caps via `capOf`, enforced/overflow logged in `clampCaps` (`S.lost`). Score 2.

**F4 Population:** Colonist records `{skill,fatigue,morale,job,at}` from `addColonist`; both `c.skill` and `c.fatigue` read in `bldEff()`. Score 2.

**F5 Needs:** `doNeeds` consumes pop food/water; shortage sets `_fShort/_wShort`, `doMorale` applies -12/-15 morale; `moraleFactor()` feeds `bldEff`; +3 recovery when fed. Score 2.

**F6 Research:** 10 nodes in `RESEARCH`; `n.pre` prereq enforced in `buyResearch`; cost deducted; effects via `RBONUS` in `bldEff`, `struts`/`forecast` in storm code, `barter` in trade prices. Score 2.

**F7 Events:** 12 entries in `EVENTS`; weighted pick in `drawEvent` (`e.w`/`tot`); 5 events (refugees, cache, ventflare, sickness, blackmarket) have 2-3 choices with distinct state effects; `S.evCd` cooldown. Score 2.

**F8 Trade:** `priceOf` reads `S.res[g]/capOf` scarcity and `S.drift[g]` (drifted each turn in `doCaravan`); `caravan.inv` limited stock; `caravanBuy`/`caravanSell` both implemented. Score 2.

**F9 Hazard:** `doStorm` periodic via `stormTimer`; severity `1+floor(turn/15)`; `damage()` lowers hp, `bldEff` hpF reduces output at <70/<30; `windbreak`+`struts` reduce via `stormMitigation`; `tryRepair` spends parts. Score 2.

**F10 Save/load:** `saveState`→JSON to textarea; `loadState` validates fields/types, returns `{err}` shown in devout. Score 2.

**F11 End conditions:** `checkEnd` sets `over='lose'` (pop 0) / `'win'` (turn≥60 + thresholds); `score()` from pop/research/stock/turn; `showEndModal` renders summary. Score 2.

**F12 UI:** `switchTab` toggles panels; log lines carry `T+l.t`; extensive `data-tip` tooltips; keydown handles Space/1-6; `@media(max-width:420px)` layout. Score 2.

**F13 Dev panel:** `runTests()` has 18 real-invariant assertions (caps, negative resources, morale/fatigue bounds, slot enforcement, cooldown, save/load hash match); `runBenchmark` runs `policyTurn` loop headlessly, prints `hashState`. Score 2.

**G1:** `RBONUS[t.b]` checked via `hasR(S,...)` in `bldEff`, adds `+0.5` multiplier to real production formula, visible in tile tooltip. Score 4.

**G2:** `doNeeds` shortfall flags → `doMorale` -12/-15 morale → `moraleFactor(c.morale)` multiplies worker efficiency in `bldEff`. Score 4.

**G3:** `doStorm`→`damage()` lowers `t.hp` → `bldEff` hpF halves/zeroes output → `tryRepair` spends parts+idle colonist fatigue → hp reset to 100. Score 4.

**G4:** `priceOf` reads `S.res[g]/capOf(g)` (stockpile scarcity) and `S.drift[g]` (drifts each turn in `doCaravan`). Score 4.

**G5:** refugees choices mutate `cols`/`res.food`/`res.water`/morale differently per branch; sickness choices mutate `setAssign`, `res.scrip`, fatigue/morale — durable state, not just log. Score 4.

